{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17207260","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17207260","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1720726001:0":{"text":"It's fresh out of the oven!","source_cn":"瞧一瞧，看一看嘞！刚出炉的至尊肉饼，皮酥肉嫩，咬一口滋...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4E5F0001EB28769","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1720726002:0":{"text":"Mmmhmm... smells great!","source_cn":"哇，闻起来好香！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD26A99BC2D52947","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1720726003:1":{"text":"Want some meatloaf, little one? Grab a bottle of fruit juice to go with it!","source_cn":"小不点儿，要不要来一个啊？我这儿还有现榨的甜果汁，搭配...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x633F349866AE61BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1720726004:1":{"text":"I'll take the meatloaf and the juice—six of each... no, make that twelve. To go, please!","source_cn":"老板，这个肉饼，还有那个果汁，全都给我包起来！每样都要...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22317818560FB33A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1720726005:1":{"text":"That's too much! This isn't an all-you-can-eat buffet!","source_cn":"喂喂喂，你点这么多干嘛？这又不是自助餐！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2F18EBE0A37422E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1720726006:0":{"text":"The children need to eat plenty while they're growing! And since I don't get out like this often, I might as well enjoy myself!","source_cn":"给孩子们吃啊，长身体的时候就要多吃点！而且，难得出来一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72295A4BEA22FB16","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1720726007:0":{"text":"Besides, why hold back when you're the one paying? Just pack it all up! My friend here is rich!","source_cn":"再说了，今天是你罗万跟班买单。老板，您尽管帮我包起来，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDBB5BADCA50E27FE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1720726008:0":{"text":"Coming right up! That's very generous of you, young man! Care for some hash browns? They're a crowd favorite!","source_cn":"哎哟！这位小哥真是大方！我这就给您安排上！我这儿的炸薯...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x78E581170D388EBB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1720726009:0":{"text":"Sure thing! And throw in six skewers as well!","source_cn":"要！当然要！还有那个烤串，也来六串！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x88F9FE272784F8FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1720726010:1":{"text":"Hey, man... any chance you could give me a discount?","source_cn":"……老板，算便宜点行不行？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89CAE2D59C95F79A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1720726011:1":{"text":"After wolfing down the food, the children's faces finally light up with pure joy. However, their smiles soon fade as a sense of loss creeps in.","source_cn":"孩子们狼吞虎咽地吃完了肉饼，喝光了果汁，脸上终于露出了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE428AD390D49E928","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1720726012:0":{"text":"Thank you so much... This is the most wonderful meal I've ever had.","source_cn":"好心的姐姐，哥哥……谢谢你们。这顿饭，是我这辈子吃过最...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0FC991599DD77290","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1720726013:0":{"text":"Same here! I feel great!","source_cn":"我也是！我有力气了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x41A2E3BF8C1A3775","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1720726014:0":{"text":"But... where do we go now? Without the bully, we're homeless...","source_cn":"可是……吃饱了以后，我们要去哪儿呢？不回到那个坏蛋身边...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E63563392CFC937","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1720726015:0":{"text":"Hmm, you've got a point...","source_cn":"这……对啊，你们没有家了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFCB668D7C3EB2549","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1720726016:0":{"text":"What should we do? We can't let them sleep on the streets! Maybe... I could take them back with me?","source_cn":"该怎么办呢？总不能让孩子们睡在大街上吧？要不……我把他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D81BC057F542C40","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1720726017:0":{"text":"That won't work... It's too strict there, and they might not be able to adapt.","source_cn":"不行……那里规矩森严，而且，他们也不一定能适应那里的生活。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE1CC01F73528A5D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1720726018:0":{"text":"I know... but I don't know what else to do.","source_cn":"我也知道……我只是太心急了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C3FB81C81ACDC4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:25:1720726018":{"text":"I know... but I don't know what else to do.","source_cn":"我也知道……我只是太心急了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C3FB81C81ACDC4E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1720726019:0":{"text":"... Ah, the temple in the lower district! I heard about it at a charity event. They take in homeless children, offer them food and shelter, and teach them to read and write.","source_cn":"……对了，教堂！我在慈善晚宴上听到过介绍，下城区的教堂...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3287A0D1AEA2E206","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1720726020:0":{"text":"I'm taking you to a new home, kids. There are comfy beds, plenty of food, and kind ladies who'll read you stories. How does that sound?","source_cn":"孩子们，别怕，姐姐送你们去一个新家，那里有温暖的床，有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE9FA5055F970547C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1720726021:0":{"text":"D-Does a place like that really exist?","source_cn":"真、真的有这样的地方吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8930C68AA83CF35C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:31:1720726022:0":{"text":"We can get food without tricking people?","source_cn":"我们不用骗人，也能有饭吃吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0AEF53B42C208B5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1720726023:0":{"text":"No one will bully us again?","source_cn":"我们再也不会被欺负了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDEA6FFD4868BA7B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1720726024:0":{"text":"Yes! You have my word!","source_cn":"真的！我向你们保证！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE306C7A58C94BED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1720726025:0":{"text":"We'd love to go there! You're the kindest person we've ever met, Lady Penny! We trust you!","source_cn":"那我们愿意去！姐姐，你是我们见过最好的人，我们相信你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF61DE60883AF8464","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:25:0:1":{"text":"They need somewhere long-term.","source_cn":"需要能长期收留他们的地方","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5BE4981DE0871659","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"They need somewhere long-term.","female":"They need somewhere long-term.","variant_male_record_index":"90609","variant_female_record_index":"90610","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:25:1:2":{"text":"Any facility that can provide them with shelter?","source_cn":"有没有可以照顾他们的机构？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xCE8498092027C099","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Any facility that can provide them with shelter?","female":"Any facility that can provide them with shelter?","variant_male_record_index":"90611","variant_female_record_index":"90612",